AgValoniaGPS
Copyright (C) 2024-2025 AgValoniaGPS Contributors

Glyph geometry resources for the GlyphButton control.
All paths are authored in a 24x24 coordinate space.

Two rendering modes coexist:
  - Stroke-rendered (default): closed shapes draw as outlines via
    Path.Stroke + StrokeThickness in the GlyphButton style.
  - Filled silhouette (IsGlyphFilled="True" at the call site): closed
    shapes draw as solid silhouettes via Path.Fill, mirroring the artist
    icon set. Comments below mark which glyphs expect IsGlyphFilled.

Naming convention: Glyph.<ButtonId>
-->
